<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins firm; butts $1.00-2.00 higher; skinned hams weak to 1.00 lower; bellies steady to 1.00 lower; lean trimmings steady to 1.00 lower.</p>
<p>Trading slow to moderate, with light to moderate demand and offerings. - USDA</p>
